Files in this repository that are generated from third party sources

  tests/doctor/fixtures/*.tar.gz
    Captures of real builds, used as test data. They contain, for each build:
    - .config files, generated by Kconfig from Zephyr and MCUboot option definitions
    - zephyr.dts files, generated from Zephyr devicetree sources (Apache-2.0)
    - a few lines of the linker map file
    - the MCUboot image header and signature TLVs of a signed image, with the program
      code replaced by zeros
    - MCUboot's binary as zeros of the same length
    They contain no third party program code and no source files. The generated .config
    and .dts files derive from Apache-2.0 licensed sources of Zephyr and MCUboot.

  tests/logs/, tests/logs_ble/
    Console output of MCUboot and Zephyr on the test board.

Code that follows a third party example

  src/ota_kit_ble.c
    The advertising setup follows the pattern of Zephyr's sample
    samples/subsys/mgmt/mcumgr/smp_svr (Apache-2.0, Copyright the Zephyr contributors).
    It was written for this project, not copied.

  Kconfig (stack size defaults)
    The two stack size values are the ones the same Zephyr sample uses.

Keys

  keys/ota_signing.pub.pem is the public half of a development signing key made for
  this project. The private half is not in the repository. Do not use this key pair.
  Generate your own.
